{"id":"encanto","lemma":"encanto","pos":"noun","rank":1971,"glosses":["charm, captivation","spell, enchantment","apparition, otherworldly entity"],"ipa":"/enˈkanto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"encantos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-encanto.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué encanto!","en":"How cute!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38584","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Las fotos en blanco y negro tienen un encanto especial.","en":"Black and white photos have a special charm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692441","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"photo, photograph","l":"foto"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"special"}],"phrases":[[2,6,"in black and white"]]},{"text":"La vieja cabaña tiene un cierto encanto.","en":"The old cottage has a certain charm about it.","words":[null,null,{"g":"cabin, cottage, hut"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"a certain, a specific"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"A three-note melody"]]},{"text":"Me gusta este cuadro, no porque sea una pieza maestra, sino porque tiene encanto.","en":"I like this picture, not because it is a masterpiece, but because it has charm.","words":[null,null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"square"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"because"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"piece, part"},{"g":"queen bee"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"because"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]}]}